      "text": "Requirements \n\n1. Auth\n2. Update profile\n3. Delete profile\n3. User galleries CRUD\n4. Share public galleries\n5. Users can invite users to private gallery\n6. Upload 5 images to build face embedding\n7. Users can download images or whole gallery\n",
